# The repo IS the addon folder — WoW loads it from
# Interface/AddOns/ExsarAddon/ — so anything the game, the OS, or a tool drops
# in here lands right next to the source. Keep those out of the history.

# --- macOS -------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# --- WoW combat logs ---------------------------------------------------------
# Captured for the timing/weave analysis written up in CLAUDE.md (the retry-timer
# and position-snapshot work). They are large, per-session, and regenerated at
# will — the conclusions belong in CLAUDE.md, not the raw logs in git.
WoWCombatLog*.txt
Archive-WoWCombatLog*.txt

